Brightwater Bike Works Employee Handbook (2026)

Welcome to the shop. This handbook covers how we work together.

Discount: Employees get 25 percent off parts and accessories, and bikes at cost plus 10 percent. Immediate family may use the discount with an employee present.

Training: Every new hire must complete Shop Safety 101 within the first week, before working a repair stand alone.

Schedules: The schedule is posted two weeks ahead. Trade shifts only with a manager's approval.

Payday: Employees are paid every other Friday by direct deposit.

Riding: Test rides by staff go no farther than the end of Canal Street.

Phones: Personal phones stay in the break room while you are on the sales floor.
